    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>911: Prey \u2013 A first-person horror escape game of hide-and-seek, survival, and deadly secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been kidnapped\u2026 again. The maniac cannibal has dragged you back to his terrifying home \ud83c\udfda\ufe0f, and your nightmare begins once more. Now it\u2019s up to you to stay out of sight, stay smart, and search for items and clues that can help you escape before you end up on tonight\u2019s menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Solve challenging puzzles to unlock new areas. Stay alert and <strong>cover your tracks</strong>\u2014if the cannibal senses something's off, your chances of survival will vanish. This time, only one ending leads to freedom\u2026 and the rest? Well, let\u2019s just say they\u2019re not so lucky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Explore every corner of the house, uncover dark secrets, and collect notes to reveal the twisted truth about Minnesota\u2019s most feared maniac. <br><br>Features:<br>\u2605 <strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2013 Your fate depends entirely on your choices<br>\u2605 <strong>Branching detective story</strong> \u2013 A dark and mysterious narrative<br>\u2605 <strong>Escape room-style puzzles</strong> \u2013 Think fast, solve smart<br>\u2605 <strong>Hide-and-seek horror gameplay</strong> \u2013 Don\u2019t leave any trace<br>\u2605 <strong>Immersive atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Detailed environment and chilling sound design<br><br>Every decision counts. Every detail matters. Can you escape alive?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>911: Prey \u2013 A first-person horror escape game of hide-and-seek, survival, and deadly secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been kidnapped\u2026 again. The maniac cannibal has dragged you back to his terrifying home \ud83c\udfda\ufe0f, and your nightmare begins once more. Now it\u2019s up to you to stay out of sight, stay smart, and search for items and clues that can help you escape before you end up on tonight\u2019s menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Solve challenging puzzles to unlock new areas. Stay alert and <strong>cover your tracks</strong>\u2014if the cannibal senses something's off, your chances of survival will vanish. This time, only one ending leads to freedom\u2026 and the rest? Well, let\u2019s just say they\u2019re not so lucky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Explore every corner of the house, uncover dark secrets, and collect notes to reveal the twisted truth about Minnesota\u2019s most feared maniac. <br><br>Features:<br>\u2605 <strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2013 Your fate depends entirely on your choices<br>\u2605 <strong>Branching detective story</strong> \u2013 A dark and mysterious narrative<br>\u2605 <strong>Escape room-style puzzles</strong> \u2013 Think fast, solve smart<br>\u2605 <strong>Hide-and-seek horror gameplay</strong> \u2013 Don\u2019t leave any trace<br>\u2605 <strong>Immersive atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Detailed environment and chilling sound design<br><br>Every decision counts. Every detail matters. Can you escape alive?</p>",
    "short_description": "You\u2019ve been kidnapped by a cannibal maniac\u2014again. Hide, solve puzzles, and cover your tracks to avoid being caught in his terrifying house. Every choice matters. Escape is possible, but only one ending leads to freedom. Will you survive the nightmare?",
